&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.4pt;font-size:12.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E02672-000:NotesRegardingLossOnDisposalOfNoncurrentAssetsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E02672-000:NotesRegardingGainOnTerritorialRightsExchangeOfNonCurrentAssetsAndLossOnDeductionOfNonCurrentAssetsWithTerritorialRightsExchangeTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.4pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※7　固定資産権利変換益及び固定資産圧縮損&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:12.4pt;"&gt;　当連結会計年度における固定資産権利変換益7,199,714千円は、八重洲一丁目北地区第一種市街地再開発事業&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.4pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;に伴う権利変換によるものです。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.4pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　なお、同額の固定資産圧縮損を計上しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E02672-000:NotesRegardingGainOnTerritorialRightsExchangeOfNonCurrentAssetsAndLossOnDeductionOfNonCurrentAssetsWithTerritorialRightsExchangeTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingReclassificationAdjustmentsAndTaxEffectsRelatingToOtherComprehensiveIncomeTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※　その他の包括利益に係る組替調整額及び税効果額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
