&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:36pt;"&gt;【借入金等明細表】&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AnnexedConsolidatedDetailedScheduleOfBorrowingsTextBlock>
